{"id":"f691a9cf082050788b14d841367e42e6f9063fae","axis":"silent","repo":"expo/expo","sha":"f691a9cf082050788b14d841367e42e6f9063fae","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/observe-consent-config-plugin.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+---","+'expo-observe': minor","+---","+","+Add a config plugin with a `consent` option. Prebuild writes the consent value to `AndroidManifest.xml` and `Info.plist`."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/expo-observe/app.plugin.js","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1 @@","+module.exports = require('./plugin/build/withObserve');"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/expo-observe/jest.config.js","lines":["@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@"," /** @type {import('jest').Config} */","-module.exports = require('@expo/internal-scripts/jest-preset');","+module.exports = require('@expo/internal-scripts/createCompositeJestPreset')(__dirname, ['plugin']);"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/expo-observe/package.json","lines":["@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@","   \"main\": \"build/index.js\",","   \"types\": \"build/index.d.ts\",","   \"exports\": {","+    \"./app.plugin.js\": \"./app.plugin.js\",","     \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\",","     \".\": {","       \"types\": {","@@ -51,7 +52,9 @@","   },","   \"scripts\": {","     \"precompile-android\": \"et prebuild-android-package-for-publish\",","-    \"build\": \"expo-build src\",","+    \"build\": \"pnpm run build:lib && pnpm run build:plugin\",","+    \"build:lib\": \"expo-build src\",","+    \"build:plugin\": \"expo-build --base plugin cjs:src\",","     \"clean\": \"expo-module clean\",","     \"lint\": \"oxlint --config oxlint.config.mjs .\",","     \"format\": \"expo-module format\",","@@ -60,7 +63,7 @@","     \"test\": \"jest\",","     \"prepublishOnly\": \"expo-module prepublishOnly\",","     \"depscheck\": \"expo-module depscheck\",","-    \"typecheck\": \"tsc -p tsconfig.json\",","+    \"typecheck\": \"tsc -b tsconfig.all.json\",","     \"prepack\": \"expo-module prepack\"","   },","   \"dependencies\": {"],"additions":5,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/expo-observe/plugin/jest.config.js","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1 @@","+module.exports = require('@expo/internal-scripts/jest-preset-plugin');"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/expo-observe/plugin/src/__tests__/withObserve-test.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,96 @@","+import type { AndroidConfig, ExportedConfig, InfoPlist, Mod } from 'expo/config-plugins';","+","+import withObserve from '../withObserve';","+","+const CONSENT_META_DATA = 'expo.modules.observe.CONSENT';","+","+async function evalModAsync<T>(","+  config: ExportedConfig,","+  platform: 'android' | 'ios',","+  mod: Mod<T> | undefined,","+  modResults: T","+) {","+  if (!mod) {","+    throw new Error('Expected the mod to be registered');","+  }","+  const result = await mod({","+    ...config,","+    modResults,","+    modRequest: {","+      projectRoot: '/app',","+      platformProjectRoot: '/app/native',","+      modName: 'test',","+      platform,","+      introspect: true,","+    },","+    modRawConfig: config,","+  });","+  return result.modResults;","+}","+","+// Runs the plugin on a fresh config, and returns the `Info.plist` and the consent `meta-data` items.","+async function applyAsync(","+  props?: Parameters<typeof withObserve>[1],","+  metaData?: AndroidConfig.Manifest.ManifestMetaData[],","+  initialInfoPlist: InfoPlist = {}","+) {","+  const config: ExportedConfig = withObserve({ name: 'test', slug: 'test' }, props);","+  const infoPlist = await evalModAsync(","+    config,","+    'ios',","+    config.mods?.ios?.infoPlist,","+    initialInfoPlist","+  );","+  const manifest = await evalModAsync(config, 'android', config.mods?.android?.manifest, {","+    manifest: {","+      $: { 'xmlns:android': 'http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android' },","+      queries: [],","+      application: [{ $: { 'android:name': '.MainApplication' }, 'meta-data': metaData }],","+    },","+  });","+  const consentItems = manifest.manifest.application?.[0]?.['meta-data']?.filter(","+    (item) => item.$['android:name'] === CONSENT_META_DATA","+  );","+  return { infoPlist, consentItems };","+}","+","+describe('withObserve', () => {","+  it('writes the `consent` option to both native projects', async () => {","+    const { infoPlist, consentItems } = await applyAsync({ consent: 'not-granted' });","+    expect(infoPlist.ExpoObserve).toEqual({ consent: 'not-granted' });","+    expect(consentItems).toEqual([","+      { $: { 'android:name': CONSENT_META_DATA, 'android:value': 'not-granted' } },","+    ]);","+  });","+","+  it.each([undefined, {}])('writes `granted` when the props are %p', async (props) => {","+    const { infoPlist, consentItems } = await applyAsync(props);","+    expect(infoPlist.ExpoObserve).toEqual({ consent: 'granted' });","+    expect(consentItems).toEqual([","+      { $: { 'android:name': CONSENT_META_DATA, 'android:value': 'granted' } },","+    ]);","+  });","+","+  it('replaces the value that an earlier prebuild wrote', async () => {","+    const { consentItems } = await applyAsync({}, [","+      { $: { 'android:name': CONSENT_META_DATA, 'android:value': 'not-granted' } },","+    ]);","+    expect(consentItems).toEqual([","+      { $: { 'android:name': CONSENT_META_DATA, 'android:value': 'granted' } },","+    ]);","+  });","+","+  it('keeps the other `ExpoObserve` settings when it replaces the consent', async () => {","+    const { infoPlist } = await applyAsync({}, undefined, {","+      ExpoObserve: { consent: 'not-granted', other: 'value' },","+    });","+    expect(infoPlist.ExpoObserve).toEqual({ consent: 'granted', other: 'value' });","+  });","+","+  it.each(['denied', null, false, ''])('throws when `consent` is %p', (consent) => {","+    expect(() =>","+      // @ts-expect-error The test passes values that the type does not allow.","+      withObserve({ name: 'test', slug: 'test' }, { consent })","+    ).toThrow(/expo-observe.*consent.*'granted'.*'not-granted'/s);","+  });","+});"],"additions":96,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/expo-observe/plugin/src/withObserve.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@","+import {","+  AndroidConfig,","+  type ConfigPlugin,","+  createRunOncePlugin,","+  withAndroidManifest,","+  withInfoPlist,","+} from 'expo/config-plugins';","+","+const pkg = require('../../package.json');","+","+const CONSENTS = ['granted', 'not-granted'] as const;","+","+export type Props = {","+  /**","+   * The consent state that the plugin writes to the native projects.","+   * @default 'granted'","+   */","+  consent?: (typeof CONSENTS)[number];","+};","+","+const withObserve: ConfigPlugin<Props | void> = (config, props) => {","+  // Only an absent option gets the default. A `null` must throw, thus `??` is not applicable.","+  const consent = props?.consent === undefined ? 'granted' : props.consent;","+  if (!CONSENTS.includes(consent)) {","+    throw new Error(","+      `The expo-observe config plugin could not set the consent because the \\`consent\\` option has an invalid value (${JSON.stringify(consent)}). Set \\`consent\\` to 'granted' or 'not-granted', or remove the option to use 'granted'.`","+    );","+  }","+","+  config = withAndroidManifest(config, (config) => {","+    AndroidConfig.Manifest.addMetaDataItemToMainApplication(","+      AndroidConfig.Manifest.getMainApplicationOrThrow(config.modResults),","+      'expo.modules.observe.CONSENT',","+      consent","+    );","+    return config;","+  });","+","+  return withInfoPlist(config, (config) => {","+    // `ios.infoPlist` or an earlier prebuild can put other Observe settings in this dictionary.","+    const settings = config.modResults.ExpoObserve;","+    config.modResults.ExpoObserve = {","+      ...(typeof settings === 'object' && !Array.isArray(settings) ? settings : {}),","+      consent,","+    };","+    return config;","+  });","+};","+","+export default createRunOncePlugin(withObserve, pkg.name, pkg.version);"],"additions":50,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/expo-observe/plugin/tsconfig.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@","+{","+  \"extends\": \"@expo/internal-scripts/tsconfig.plugin\",","+  \"compilerOptions\": {","+    \"composite\": true,","+    \"rootDir\": \"./src\",","+    \"noEmit\": true,","+    \"types\": [\"node\", \"jest\"]","+  },","+  \"include\": [\"./src\"]","+}"],"additions":10,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/expo-observe/tsconfig.all.json","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@","+{","+  \"files\": [],","+  \"references\": [","+    {","+      \"path\": \"./tsconfig.json\"","+    },","+    {","+      \"path\": \"./plugin\"","+    }","+  ]","+}"],"additions":11,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/expo-observe/tsconfig.json","lines":["@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@"," {","   \"extends\": \"@expo/internal-scripts/tsconfig.base\",","   \"compilerOptions\": {","+    \"composite\": true,","     \"rootDir\": \"./src\",","     \"noEmit\": true,","     \"emitDeclarationOnly\": true",""],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":181,"deletions":3,"truncated":false,"file_count":10},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-24T20:29:00.491345+00:00"}